Package: com.huhansibuxin.powerlogprobe
Name: PowerlogProbe
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: PLAN A - aggregated/PowerlogCore write filter. Whitelists only the entryKeys needed by Settings > Battery per-App usage (energy ledger, application runtime, battery curve) and short-circuits every other write at PLCoreStorage / PLSQLiteConnection. Includes a PASSTHROUGH_ALL flag-file A-B switch and event-count logging.
Maintainer: huhansibuxin
Author: huhansibuxin
Section: Tweaks
Depends: ellekit
